markdown <<MARKDOWN
You are helping an airline learn from its aircraft and flight data.

**☑️ Do This:**
- Open [this spreadsheet](https://drive.google.com/file/d/1TRSvhTh3PsceqtCoVBNq0fYhKexzm5f5/view?usp=sharing) containing data for the airline.
- Look at a few different rows of data in the dataset, exploring each row’s values.
- In **Step 2** of your Project Planning Guide, write down at least three questions that could be answered by the dataset. Choose questions for which the answers might be useful to the airline!

MARKDOWN
